{"path":"identifier_with_special_meaning/import","title":"C++ identifier with special meaning: import (since C++20)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">C++ identifier with special meaning:</span><code>import</code><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/identifier_with_special_meaning/import","section":"identifier_with_special_meaning","kind":"page","summary":"","html":"<h3 id=\"Usage\">Usage</h3>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/modules#Importing_modules_and_headers\"><code>module</code> <i>import declaration</i></a>: imports a set of translation units\n</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code>export module foo<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\nimport bar<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>   <span class=\"co1\">// imports all module interface units of module bar</span>\nimport <span class=\"sy4\">:</span>baz<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>  <span class=\"co1\">// imports the so-named module partition baz of module foo</span>\nimport <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>set<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// imports a synthesized header unit formed from header &lt;set&gt;</span></code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/export\"><code>export</code></a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/identifier_with_special_meaning/module\"><code>module</code></a>\n</li></ul>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Usage","id":"Usage"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"C++ identifier with special meaning: import (since C++20)","children":[{"label":"Usage"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also"}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":53,"codeBlockCount":1}
